msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"(The building he's talking about is probably the Millennium\r\n"
"Tower. He also mentioned a street with a lot of stores...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "(Guess I'll give Nakamichi Street a try.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "(Guess I'll try the west end of Taihei Boulevard.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "It's Rikiya. I'm real pissed at you, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Sorry, Rikiya. I never should have said you could come.\r\n"
"So, what's up? Did something happen down there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "No, that's not why I'm calling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Hm? Then what is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Well... I'm in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "What? Why!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "I know you wanted me to stay in Okinawa, Aniki..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"But I wasn't gonna just sit by while you went n' found the\r\n"
"bastard who shot the boss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Rikiya..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"Oh, and I left Mikio in charge of the orphanage. The kids'll\r\n"
"be fine with him, don't worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "(I guess as long as someone's looking after them...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Sorry, Aniki. I know you were just tryin' to protect me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"It's okay, Rikiya. I'm sorry for just leaving you there in\r\n"
"the dark."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Aniki..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "More importantly. Where are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Huh? I, uh... Well. I don't got the slightest idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "What? Surely you can figure out what street you're on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"Not really. I can't tell up from down in this friggin'\r\n"
"place. It's like a maze."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "And... you didn't think to get a map before you showed up here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"It's all right, I'll be there as soon as I can. In the\r\n"
"meantime, try and find a landmark to wait at."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "What, ya mean like a tall buildin' or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "Anything that stands out. Let me know once you have a place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Gotcha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Talk to you later, Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Yup!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Must be Nakamichi Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "Totally Taihei Boulevard."
msgstr ""

